---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BrandIcon from '../components/BrandIcon.astro';
---

<Layout title="Saber De Sabor — Sushi Bar Casual en Peñaflor" description="Sushi bar casual en Peñaflor, RM. Rolls frescos, promos para uno o para compartir. Pide por WhatsApp." current="inicio">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[92vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img src="/images/local-noche.webp" alt="Saber De Sabor sushi bar de noche" class="w-full h-full object-cover" width="900" height="1482" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-bg1 via-bg1/85 to-bg1/30"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg1 via-transparent to-bg1/40"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-20 w-full">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div data-reveal class="tag mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-lime2 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Abierto hoy · 6 PM – 11 PM</span>
          <span class="text-neutral-600">·</span>
          <span>Peñaflor, RM</span>
        </div>
        <h1 data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" class="hero-title font-display font-700 text-[16vw] md:text-[10vw] lg:text-[9rem]">
          Saber<br><span class="gradient-text">De Sabor</span>
        </h1>
        <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-2xl text-neutral-300 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
          Sushi casual, fresco y sin pretensiones. Rolls que se disfrutan solos o en buena compañía — directo desde Peñaflor para tu mesa.
        </p>
        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3" class="mt-9 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href="/menu" class="btn-coral px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-display font-600 text-base flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5">
            Ver menú <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/56973341304" target="_blank" class="btn-wsp px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-display font-600 text-base flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5">
            <BrandIcon name="whatsapp" class="text-xl" /> Pedir por WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>

        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4" class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-md">
          <div>
            <div class="font-display font-700 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-coral">+30</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Rolls en carta</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display font-700 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-lime2">15'</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Delivery en Peñaflor</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display font-700 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-salmon">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Fresco cada día</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-neutral-500 text-xs flex flex-col items-center gap-2 animate-bounce">
      <span class="uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Scroll</span>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARQUEE -->
  <div class="marquee py-6 border-y border-white/5 bg-bg2/50">
    <div class="marquee-inner">
      <span class="marquee-item">Rollos frescos <span class="text-coral">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item text-neutral-600">Peñaflor · Malloco <span class="text-lime2">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Combos para compartir <span class="text-salmon">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item text-neutral-600">Delivery sin cargo <span class="text-coral">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Volcán Peñaflor <span class="text-lime2">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item text-neutral-600">Sushi casual <span class="text-salmon">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Rollos frescos <span class="text-coral">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item text-neutral-600">Peñaflor · Malloco <span class="text-lime2">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Combos para compartir <span class="text-salmon">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item text-neutral-600">Delivery sin cargo <span class="text-coral">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item">Volcán Peñaflor <span class="text-lime2">✦</span></span>
      <span class="marquee-item text-neutral-600">Sushi casual <span class="text-salmon">✦</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="py-24 md:py-32 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div data-reveal>
          <div class="tag mb-6">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-coral"></span>
            <span>Sobre Nosotros</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-700 text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[0.95] mb-6">
            Sushi sin<br><span class="text-coral">pose</span>, con <span class="text-lime2">alma</span>.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">
            En <strong class="text-white">Saber De Sabor</strong> creemos que el buen sushi no necesita ceremonias. Ven tal como estás, después del trabajo, con amigos o solo contigo. Acá los rolls se arman frescos cada día, con pescado seleccionado y un toque bien chileno.
          </p>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            ¿Estás comiendo solo? Mejor todavía. Pide un roll, siéntate en la barra y déjate llevar. Ése es el plan: rico, simple y sin enredos.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <span class="tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf text-lime2"></i> Ingredientes frescos</span>
            <span class="tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-salmon"></i> Hecho al momento</span>
            <span class="tag"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart text-coral"></i> Ambiente relajado</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="relative">
          <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/images/local-dia.webp" alt="Fachada del local Saber De Sabor" class="w-full h-[480px] object-cover" width="900" height="727" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg1/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-4 md:-left-8 bg-bg2 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-2xl max-w-[230px]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coral/20 flex items-center justify-center text-coral">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-display font-600 text-sm">Peñaflor, RM</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Malloquito 1985</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Local B, a pasos del centro. Estacionamiento en la calle.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute -top-6 -right-4 md:-right-6 w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-lime2/10 border border-lime2/30 flex items-center justify-center text-lime2 rotate-6">
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="font-display font-700 text-2xl leading-none">100%</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Casero</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROMOS -->
  <section class="py-24 md:py-28 relative bg-bg2/40 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-reveal>
        <div class="tag mb-5 mx-auto inline-flex">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-salmon"></span>
          <span>Promos Destacadas</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-700 text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[0.95]">
          Las favoritas <span class="gradient-text">de la casa</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 mt-4">Tres opciones que nunca fallan — para uno, para todos, o para darte un gusto.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Promo 1 -->
        <article data-reveal class="promo-card">
          <div class="promo-img-wrap relative h-56">
            <img src="/images/promo-1.webp" alt="Promo 1 - 20 piezas" class="w-full h-full object-cover" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 badge badge-coral">Promo 1</div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg2 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">20 piezas</div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-2xl mb-2">Promo 1</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-5">Especial palta (camarón, queso crema) y Frito (pollo, queso crema, cebollín).</p>
            <div class="flex items-end justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Precio</div>
                <div class="font-display font-700 text-3xl text-coral">$6.500</div>
              </div>
              <a href="https://wa.me/56973341304?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20pedir%20la%20Promo%201%20(%246.500)" target="_blank" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-coral text-bg1 flex items-center justify-center hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Promo 4 -->
        <article data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" class="promo-card">
          <div class="promo-img-wrap relative h-56">
            <img src="/images/promo-4.webp" alt="Promo 4 - 40 piezas" class="w-full h-full object-cover" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 badge badge-lime">Más vendido</div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg2 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">40 piezas</div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-2xl mb-2">Promo 4</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-5">Surtido completo: Tempura, Pollo, Camarón, Panko, Kanikama y Palmito.</p>
            <div class="flex items-end justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Precio</div>
                <div class="font-display font-700 text-3xl text-lime2">$12.000</div>
              </div>
              <a href="https://wa.me/56973341304?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20pedir%20la%20Promo%204%20(%2412.000)" target="_blank" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-lime2 text-bg1 flex items-center justify-center hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Promo 6 -->
        <article data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="promo-card">
          <div class="promo-img-wrap relative h-56">
            <img src="/images/promo-6.webp" alt="Promo 6 - 60 piezas" class="w-full h-full object-cover" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 badge badge-salmon">Para compartir</div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg2 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">60 piezas</div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-2xl mb-2">Promo 6</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-5">Especial palta, Salmón, queso crema, cebollín y más. ¡La fiesta completa!</p>
            <div class="flex items-end justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Precio</div>
                <div class="font-display font-700 text-3xl text-salmon">$18.900</div>
              </div>
              <a href="https://wa.me/56973341304?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20pedir%20la%20Promo%206%20(%2418.900)" target="_blank" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-salmon text-bg1 flex items-center justify-center hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES -->
  <section class="py-24 md:py-32 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-reveal>
        <div class="tag mb-5 mx-auto inline-flex">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-lime2"></span>
          <span>Servicios</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-700 text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[0.95]">
          Como tú <span class="text-lime2">quieras</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 mt-4">Come en el local, pide para llevar o recíbelo en casa. Tú eliges el plan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6">
        <div data-reveal class="service-card text-center">
          <div class="service-icon bg-coral/15 text-coral"><i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i></div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-lg mb-2">Consumo en el local</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">Siéntate, relájate y disfruta en nuestro ambiente casual.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" class="service-card text-center">
          <div class="service-icon bg-lime2/15 text-lime2"><i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i></div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-lg mb-2">Para llevar</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">Pide por WhatsApp y pasa a buscarlo cuando esté listo.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="service-card text-center relative overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/images/Delivery.webp" alt="Delivery" style="width: 110px; height: 110px; margin: 0 auto -10px; object-fit: contain;" width="150" height="150" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-lg mb-2 mt-1">Entrega a domicilio</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">Despacho sin cargo en Peñaflor y Malloco (excepto propinas).</p>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3" class="service-card text-center">
          <div class="service-icon bg-salmon/15 text-salmon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-virus"></i></div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-lg mb-2">Entrega sin contacto</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">Dejamos tu pedido en la puerta y te avisamos al llegar.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- QUICK INFO -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-bg2/60 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div data-reveal>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-coral/15 text-coral flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-xl"></i></div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-lg mb-2">Dónde estamos</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Malloquito 1985, Local B<br>9750000 Peñaflor, RM</p>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-lime2/15 text-lime2 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock text-xl"></i></div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-lg mb-2">Horario</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">Lun a Sáb · 6 PM – 11 PM<br>Jueves a Dom · 6 PM – 11 PM<br><span class="text-coral">Miércoles cerrado</span></p>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-salmon/15 text-salmon flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-xl"></i></div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-600 text-lg mb-2">Contáctanos</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-3">+56 9 7334 1304</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/56973341304" target="_blank" class="btn-wsp inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-display font-600">
            <BrandIcon name="whatsapp" /> Escríbenos
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>